charter.md
journal/
notes/
# Same reason: docs/onboarding/03-first-beats.md says to copy
# backend/beats.example.json here and edit the prompts, so this file carries
# an operator's own standing prompts as soon as it is useful. The example it
# is copied from stays tracked.
/beats.json

# Runtime memory-health snapshots (local state, machine-specific)
backend/memory_health_history.jsonl
